''This was the initial version of Booster Pack #4 for the [[Afterbirth †]] DLC expansion. For an overview on content, see [[Booster Pack #4]].''

== Documented changes ==
=== New items ===
* {{i|Death's List}} (530), which is based on [http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=908104321 this Steam Workshop item] by Merlo.
* {{i|Haemolacria}} (531), which is based on [http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=915837573 this Steam Workshop item] by HiHowAreYou.
* {{i|Lachryphagy}} (532), which is based on [http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=893096768 this Steam Workshop item] by Echo.
* {{i|Trisagion}} (533), which is based on [http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=894879673 this Steam Workshop item] by x Wyvern x.
* {{i|Schoolbag}} (534), which is based on the [https://isaacracing.net/ Racing+] implementation of the [[anti:Schoolbag|Schoolbag]] from [https://antibirth.com/ Antibirth].

=== New trinkets ===
* {{t|Extension Cord}} (125), which is based on [http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=894760381 this Steam Workshop item] by Strawrat, which was originally a passive collectible.

== Undocumented changes ==
