* {{e|Soul Sucker}} (61.2; variant of a {{e|Sucker}}).
* {{e|Cross Stone Shooter}} (202.10; variant of a {{e|Constant Stone Shooter}}).
* {{e|Tube Worm}} (244.1; variant of a {{e|Round Worm}}).
* {{e|Tar Boy}} (307.0).
* {{e|Fistuloid}} (308.0).
* {{e|Gush}} (309.0).

=== New graphics ===
* {{i|Broken Modem}} collectible sprite was changed.
* {{i|Technology Zero}} collectible and costume sprites were changed.
* {{i|Angry Fly}} collectible and familiar sprites were changed.
* {{i|Sprinkler}} collectible and entity sprites were changed.
* {{i|7 Seals}} collectible and familiar sprites were changed. Familiar sprites were based on [http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=1098300666 this Steam Workshop mod] by Quartz.
* {{i|Pop!}} collectible sprite was changed.
* {{t|Hairpin}} trinket sprite was changed.
* {{t|Butter!}} trinket sprite was changed.
* {{t|Door Stop}} trinket sprite was changed.

=== Room changes ===
* Removed the stacked angel statue from Devil Room #11.
* Added 10 unique rooms to {{s|Basement}}. ({{s|Burning Basement}} has the same rooms.)
* Added 10 unique rooms to {{s|Cellar}}.
* Added 16 unique rooms to {{s|Caves}}.
* Added 19 unique rooms to {{s|Catacombs}}.
* Added 66 unique rooms to {{s|Flooded Caves}}.
* Added 21 unique rooms to {{s|Depths}}.
* Added 56 unique rooms to {{s|Necropolis}}.
* Added 53 unique rooms to {{s|Dank Depths}}.
* Added 31 unique rooms to {{s|Womb}}.
* Added 37 unique rooms to {{s|Utero}}.
* Added 20 unique rooms to {{s|Scarred Womb}}.
* Added 25 unique rooms to {{s|Cathedral}}.
* Added 70 unique rooms to {{s|Sheol}}.
* Added 7 unique rooms to {{s|Chest}}.
* Added 7 unique rooms to {{s|Dark Room}}.

=== Other changes ===
* Key Pieces will now drop from angels that are not in [[Angel Room]]s.
* The {{i|Dead Eye}} multiplier will no longer be lost when hitting poops or TNT barrels.
* [[Blended Heart]]s will now appear on the minimap as soul hearts.

=== Bug fixes ===
* Fixed the bug where [[Rage Creep]]'s brimstone was moved upwards during the Afterbirth release and caused the player to take damage along the top wall in Womb/Utero room #202.
* Fixed the bug where [[pickup]] velocities were not seeded from machines, beggars, tinted rocks, chests, sacks, and bosses.
* Fixed the bug where the "[[RERUN]]" option would not appear if any mods were enabled.
* Fixed the bug where if you quit and continue in a shop or secret room with a [[Greed]] in it, the Greed would despawn and a [[Super Greed]] would appear.
* Fixed the bug where [[Half Soul Heart]]s appeared on the minimap as red hearts.
* Fixed the bug where the number of flies from {{i|Guppy's Head}} was unseeded.
* Fixed the bug where the champion [[Scolex]] was using the wrong graphics (from the black [[The Frail|Frail]] champion).
* Fixed the bug where the [[Adult]] transformation sprite was misaligned.

== New bugs ==
* Taking the {{i|Schoolbag}} can lead to graphical glitches that usually manifest as white squares. When this occurs, the game will (eventually) crash.

